assignTree.description:
Logic expression tree: wire name (string) or ["op", {attributes}?, ...operands].
Shape gates: & | ^ (AND OR XOR), ~& ~| ~^ (NAND NOR XNOR), ~ (NOT), buf1, + - * / %, aliases and or xor andr orr xorr add sub mul input;
IEC boxes: BUF INV AND NAND OR NOR XOR XNOR eq ne slt sle sgt sge ult ule ugt uge box CONCAT case casez casex;
MUX; flip-flops ff[n][e][c|p[n]][r|s[n]] (e.g. ff, ffe, ffr, ffnecrn); bit slice "[7:0]";
"=" with name + expression ["=", "net", expr] labels an intermediate net;
pin / pout / pinout with {"instance", "pin"} attributes draw module ports;
any other string is drawn as a labeled box.

oneOf.description:
One character per cycle (period):
p n - clock with positive / negative edge first; P N - same with arrow;
h l - high / low with sharp edge; H L - same with arrow;
0 1 - low / high level; x - undefined; z - high impedance; u - pull-up (weak 1); d - pull-down (weak 0);
= 2 3 4 5 6 7 8 9 - data value with color (= is color 2), labels taken from "data";
. - extend previous state; | - extend and draw a gap (break) mark;
< > - start / end sub-cycle group: each character inside takes one brick (half a cycle) instead of a full period.
Unknown characters are rendered as "x".

items.description:
Arrow: "<from><shape><to> [label]", e.g. "a~>b", "c-|->d 5 ns".
from / to: node characters; label: rest of the string after the first space.
Shapes: - straight, ~ curve, -~ / ~- curve with horizontal start / end, -| / |- corner, -|- step;
append > for arrowhead (->, ~>, -~>, ~->, -|>, |->, -|->), prefix < for double-headed (<->, <~>, <-~>, <-|>, <-|->);
+ straight line with tee ends (for time spans).
Unknown shape is drawn as a red straight line; edges with undefined nodes are ignored.

gaps.description:
Vertical gap / time-break marks across all lanes, space-separated, one token per cycle (drawn at the middle of the cycle):
. - none; 0 - blank; 1 or | - single line; 2 - double line; 3 - triple line;
[ ] - square bracket; ( ) - round bracket; )( (( )) - double round brackets;
s - wave gap (break) symbol on every lane.
